title: Wage Demands and Strikes
subtitle: Real wages have stayed below 80 for three months; the workers demand a rise.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_union_rules && PolishUnions.caseDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event society.strike_1923, B8+B10 (technical reference 17.5, 17.16.5; card catalogue 9.8): one answer of PPS for
// 0 T with the state's answer in the same phase. Three months of real wages below 80 open the case; the grievance
// of 15.1 comes with stage 7 (decision 1A of stage 6). A strike then goes to its partner and protection steps.
PolishUnions.caseView(Q);
!}

= Wage demands and strikes

[+ pl_case_text +]

- @negotiate
- @economic_strike
- @cabinet_resignation

@negotiate
title: Negotiate before the protest spreads
subtitle: A limited wage offer (threshold 40); the government answers now. No strike spares the fund but weakens the pressure; a refusal is no concession.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.caseStatus(Q, 'negotiate').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_case_negotiate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.caseChoose(Q, 'negotiate');
!}
go-to: result

@economic_strike
title: A limited strike for wages and working conditions
subtitle: The covered branches strike for the agreed demands (threshold 40); the union funds pay every active month.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.caseStatus(Q, 'economic_strike').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_case_economic_strike_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.caseChoose(Q, 'economic_strike');
!}
go-to: polish_strike_steps

@cabinet_resignation
title: Join the strike to a demand that the cabinet resign
subtitle: A political goal (threshold 80): the Left −3 dissent under the class line, the Centre +8 without it. A resignation needs a real departure or a vote.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.caseStatus(Q, 'cabinet_resignation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_case_cabinet_resignation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.caseChoose(Q, 'cabinet_resignation');
!}
go-to: polish_strike_steps

@result
new-page: true

= Wage demands and strikes

[+ pl_union_result +]

- @root: Continue.
